## Whole-file declarations, data, registration and contextual obligations (unit-1)

This XHTML crash fixture gives the document a 10px font and applies height: 2891380em to tbody, td, and tr elements marked tall. Its deliberately unusual nested table cells and rows stress table layout with a very large computed height. The crashtest manifest loads this file and labels the case nscoord overflow. It asserts survival of the load/layout path, with no reference image, JavaScript assertion, or numeric expected geometry.


